 "title": "【漏洞預警】Fortinet 裝置存在繞過身分驗證漏洞(CVE-2025-22252)",
 "source_url": "https://www.cysh.cy.edu.tw/p/406-1008-132101,r19.php",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "轉發 台灣電腦網路危機處理暨協調中心 TWCERTCC-200-202505-00000015",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "日前Fortinet發布重大資安漏洞公告，指出多項產品受到影響，包括FortiOS、FortiProxy與FortiSwitchManager。此漏洞(CVE-2025-22252，CVSS：9.0)為允許攻擊者繞過身分驗證並取得管理存取權限。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "情資分享等級: WHITE(情資內容為可公開揭露之資訊)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[影響平台:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiOS 7.6.0",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiOS 7.4.4 至 7.4.6",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiProxy 7.6.0 至 7.6.1",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiSwitchManager 7.2.5",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[建議措施:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "請更新至以下版本：",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiOS 7.6.1(含)之後版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiOS 7.4.7(含)之後版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiProxy 7.6.2(含)之後版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● FortiSwitchManager 7.2.6(含)之後版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
